Prose is never searched: lapply( rnorm( data.frame( stay silent here.

```{r, include = FALSE}
hidden_include <- lapply(1:3, identity)
```

```{r hide-echo, echo = FALSE}
hidden_echo <- sapply(1:3, identity)
```

```{r hide-echo-f, echo=F, fig.width = 5}
hidden_echo_f <- vapply(1:3, identity, numeric(1))
```

```{r hide-pipe}
#| echo: false
hidden_pipe <- rnorm(3)
```

```{r hide-include-tight, include=FALSE}
hidden_include_tight <- runif(3)
```

```{r shown-plain}
